<title>CANADA: Key Canadian ag offices to be closed for holidays.</title>
<headline>Key Canadian ag offices to be closed for holidays.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Winnipeg Commodity Exchange and the Canadian Wheat Board will be closed on Christmas Day, December 25, Boxing Day, Dec 26 and on New Year's Day, January 1.</p>
<p>Manitoba Pool Elevators and Manitoba Pork, which both provide morning and afternoon cash grain and hog price quotes, will also be closed on those dates.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
